aded a style.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"style","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The style that was loaded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is called during the initialization of the map view and after any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subsequent loading of a new style. This method is called between the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapViewWillStartRenderingMap:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapViewDidFinishRenderingMap:"},{"type":"text","text":" delegate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods. Changes to sources or layers of the current style do not cause this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method to be called."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is the earliest opportunity to modify the layout or appearance of","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current style before the map view is displayed to the user."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Related-examples","text":"Related examples","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Dynamically style interactive points"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add multiple shapes from a single shape source examples, learn how to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ensure a map’s style has loaded before modifying it at runtime"}]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:didfinishloadingstyle:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:didFinishLoadingStyle:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Tells the delegate that the map has just finished loading a style.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:didfinishloadingstyle:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:didFinishLoadingStyle:","title":"mapView:didFinishLoadingStyle:","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:didFinishLoadingStyle:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapViewDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNMapViewDelegate","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"require the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"type":"text","text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"individual annotations."}]}}}